---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import image1 from '../assets/point4.jpg';
import image2 from '../assets/point1.jpg';
import image3 from '../assets/point2.jpg';
import image4 from '../assets/point3.jpg';
import image5 from '../assets/point5.jpg';
import Image from 'astro/components/Image.astro';
---

<Layout>
<section class="projects">
        <div class="column-1"> 
            <div class="a-container">
                <Image src={image1} alt="a" />
            </div>
            <div class="a-container">
                <Image src={image2} alt="a" />
            </div>
            <div class="a-container">
                <Image src={image3} alt="a" />
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="column-2">
            <div class="a-container">
                <Image src={image4} alt="a" />
            </div>
            <div class="a-container">
                <Image src={image5} alt="a" />
            </div>

            <h5>in this project, pictures were reproduced by hand on light sensitive film for a 35 mm camera. the work was precise, and a lot of information was lost from the original pictures, which resulted in almost abstract images. the process of compressing was countered by additional enlarging: reproducing them once more by hand on big sheets of textile. these works were exhibited in a large installation, posing the question; what remains?</h5>

        </div>

    </section>
</Layout>
